   ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮   
   │ Move                                Conversations                      │   
   │ j/k       down / up                 a         archive                  │   
   │ J/K       page down / up            dd        move to Trash            │   
   │ ^d/^u     half page down / up       I         move to Inbox            │   
   │ gg/G      top / bottom              N         mark read / unread       │   
   │ h/l       pane left / right         *         star / unstar            │   
   │ enter/esc open / back               x         select for bulk actions  │   
   │ n/p       next / prev (reader)      u         undo the last change     │   
   │                                     o         expand / collapse all    │   
   │ Everywhere                          O         open in Gmail (web)      │   
   │ /         search all mail                                              │   
   │ s         sync now                  Go to                              │   
   │ [/]       previous / next account   gi        Inbox                    │   
   │ b         show / hide mailboxes     gs        Starred                  │   
   │ ?         this help                 gt        Sent                     │   
   │ q         quit                      gd        Drafts                   │   
   │                                     ga        All Mail                 │   
   │                                     g#        Trash                    │   
   │                                     g!        Spam                     │   
   │                                                                        │   
   │ Press any key to close.                                                │   
   ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯   
                                                                                